八、合规审核：把人工经验沉淀成规则
public class ComplianceEngine {
private final List<ComplianceRule> rules;

public ComplianceEngine(List<ComplianceRule> rules) {
    this.rules = rules;
}

public List<ComplianceResult> audit(ItemDetail detail, String site) {
    List<ComplianceResult> results = new ArrayList<>();
    for (ComplianceRule rule : rules) {
        try {
            results.add(rule.check(detail, site));
        } catch (Exception e) {
            results.add(ComplianceResult.error(rule.name(), e.getMessage()));
        }
    }
    return results;
}

}
规则要可配置化，把违禁词表、认证要求、类目禁售清单放在配置中心，运营可以自行维护，避免每次调整都发版。
